+# Neow Calendar 1.0.0 (10) — TestFlight
+
+Uploaded on 2026-10-23 at 02:34:51 KST with Xcode, exit 0, `Upload succeeded` and `EXPORT SUCCEEDED`. Apple processing completed. The authenticated App Store Connect build detail confirms the existing **Internal** group is attached with **2 testers**. Korean test notes are saved. No new tester/group or public App Store submission was created.
+
+Source: `76b9141` (feature commit `ebfaddb`). This build displays marked NeowFocus daily summaries alongside the explicitly selected connected calendar, fences revoked/disconnected reads, avoids duplicate summaries and opens them read-only. NeowFocus **0.1.1 (14)** is the companion build.
+
+Validation: full TypeScript, ESLint, **199 tests** including **27 calendar connection tests**, archive bundle/Expo config versions, calendar purpose strings, EventKit linkage, strict deep signing and release Hermes feature markers all passed. Actual iPhone installation, real Apple account iCloud/EventKit propagation and cross-app round trips remain unverified.
+
+The upload reported non-blocking missing dSYMs for React.framework, ReactNativeDependencies.framework and hermesvm.framework; framework crash symbolication may be limited.
+
